# No Cursor attribution

Do not add Cursor, AI, or tool attribution to commits, pull requests, or code comments.

Never include any of these:
- `Co-authored-by: Cursor`
- `Co-authored-by: cursoragent@cursor.com`
- `Made with Cursor`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- `--trailer` flags that mention Cursor

Commit messages and PR bodies should contain only the subject and body the user asked for.
